    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d647">

                <pb facs="0706" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg448"/>

                <head>[Enclosure 2]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">NOTE ON OPINION</p>
                <p>My answer to question No. 1 proceeded upon the assumption that the question
                    related to claims <hi rendition="#italic">against third parties</hi> as
                    indicated in the instructions. The party giving the indemnity is debarred from
                    claiming against the Procurator General and other Official persons in respect of
                    the goods released. The object of demanding the indemnity would otherwise be
                    defeated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Goldsmith Building. Temple, E. C.</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-03"><hi rendition="#italic">3rd
                                June, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Leslie Scott</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
